#: authswitch/gui.py:1079
msgid ""
"Upgrade installs all pending updates of a node, the same as the Upgrade "
"button of the web interface. It stays within the installed major version; "
"moving to the next one needs the official upgrade guide."
msgstr ""
"Upgraden installiert alle ausstehenden Updates eines Knotens, wie der "
"Upgrade-Knopf der Weboberfläche. Es bleibt innerhalb der installierten "
